2782..2859 Comment "/// close and the operator\'s receipt, the operator\'s choice precedes only the"
2860..2930 Comment "/// receipt, and no module of the four joins them — the N-shape, the"
2931..2975 Comment "/// operator\'s receipt and close one factor."
